      "id": "sol.amc-12b-2015-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\((-2)^{-2} = \\dfrac{1}{(-2)^2} = \\dfrac14,\\) we get \\(2 - \\dfrac14 = \\dfrac74.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
      "hints": [
        "\\(a^{-2} = \\dfrac{1}{a^2}\\)",
        "\\((-2)^2 = 4,\\) so subtract \\(\\dfrac14\\) from \\(2\\)"
